              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Adamu walalaga na muki' wakwe, nawe wav'yalaga hangi' mwana wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Seti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Seti” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'yali'lwa”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wayombaga ati', “Nayali'lagwa na Mulungu ku'pandi'ka mwana yu'ngi' ha lwandi' lwamwa Habele u'yo Kaini wamuwu'lagile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Seti wapandi'kaga mwana wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Enoshi. Na hene haho v'antu' v'asangwa v'alamulaga ku'mwisenga Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' lina lyakwe Yahweh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Yahweh” ninga “Yehova” li'li' lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' Ki'ebulania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
